LUA

Computers run Lua 5.2 (Cobalt). Loading precompiled bytecode is not
allowed. Libraries: base, string, table, math, coroutine, bit32,
utf8, os (clock, date, time), unicode, computer, component.

Memory is limited by the RAM installed (computer.freeMemory()).
A program that runs for 5 seconds without waiting for a signal gets
"too long without yielding"; call os.sleep(0) in long loops.

The `lua` program is an interactive prompt.
